{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月，金旺土虚，需火生扶。日支坐巳火为印星，但巳申合水，火气被泄。时柱壬申，壬水为正财，申金为伤官，伤官生财，财星透干。年柱庚申，伤官旺，月柱甲申，正官坐伤官，官星被伤官克制，婚姻宫（日支）受合，感情易有波折。\n\n2022壬寅年，流年天干壬水为正财，地支寅木为正官，寅申冲，冲动年、月、时支的申金，也冲动日支巳火（寅巳申三刑）。此年官星（夫星）出现，但被冲刑，主婚姻宫动荡。命主八字伤官旺，伤官克官，自身对婚姻不满或易有外心；流年正官出现，代表丈夫或婚姻关系被引动，冲刑并见，多主矛盾爆发。\n\n结合选项，命主伤官旺而正官弱，自身易有外遇倾向；流年官星受冲，丈夫发现外遇的可能性大。但日支巳火为印星，印能化杀生身，且巳申合，有缓和之意，故丈夫可能原谅，未离婚。因此最符合的是A。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5609, "response_id": "ead00e5d-1d4a-40cb-a96a-0bcb688e6261", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 294, "completion_tokens": 306, "total_tokens": 600, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 38}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
